<title>POLAND: ROLIMPEX BUYS POLISH SUGAR REFINERY.</title>
<headline>ROLIMPEX BUYS POLISH SUGAR REFINERY.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish food trader Rolimpex SA has bought sugar refinery Cukrownia Dobre w Dobrem Kujawskim, Rolimpex said on Wednesday without revealing the value of the transaction.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the refinery, in Dobre Kujawskie, central Poland, was processing 2,000 tonnes of sugar beets per day.</p>
<p>Rolimpex officials were not immediately available for comment. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
